{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new type of bullet hell action game is born! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the moment when a barrage of shouts is deflected with a shield, overturning the conventional wisdom of bullet hell games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I composed all the music and did all the programming myself, and completed the project with the help of illustrations and arrangements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and diverse mecha (weapons). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim 360 degrees with the right stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block the attacks of powerful enemies with your shield and counterattack when you see an opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place in beautiful night-time cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle begins with memorable soundtracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Compatible with Xbox controllers and PC controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can also play with a PS5 controller, PS4 controller, or Switch Pro controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a PS5 controller, PS4 controller, or Switch Pro controller, you can play by using a free tool called DS4Windows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health Warning: This game contains images that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy or a history of similar conditions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3128270?t=1761210949","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3128270?t=1761210949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128270/ccf76ef56de0b846597f690c36965e528dfab1fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761210949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128270/ccf76ef56de0b846597f690c36965e528dfab1fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761210949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new type of bullet hell action game is born! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the moment when a barrage of shouts is deflected with a shield, overturning the conventional wisdom of bullet hell games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I composed all the music and did all the programming myself, and completed the project with the help of illustrations and arrangements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and diverse mecha (weapons). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim 360 degrees with the right stick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block the attacks of powerful enemies with your shield and counterattack when you see an opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place in beautiful night-time cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle begins with memorable soundtracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Compatible with Xbox controllers and PC controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can also play with a PS5 controller, PS4 controller, or Switch Pro controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a PS5 controller, PS4 controller, or Switch Pro controller, you can play by using a free tool called DS4Windows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health Warning: This game contains images that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy or a history of similar conditions.</p>","developers":["YUMEYUME"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/31282